    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the platform games of the 90s with &quot;RISKY CHRONICLES and the Curse of Destiny&quot;! Experience a captivating adventure that cleverly blends classic platform game elements with modern mechanics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on the role of Risky, a fearless explorer, as you are transported through mythical locations such as an ancient pyramid, a mysterious Aztec temple, a ruthless desert, an enchanting underwater world, a haunted house full of secrets, an ancient military factory with intriguing mechanisms, a prehistoric cave full of mysteries, and many other surprises!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith diverse gameplay featuring levels in 2D and sequences in 3D scaling, &quot;RISKY CHRONICLES and the Curse of Destiny&quot; offers unforgettable encounters with end-level bosses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLet yourself be carried away by an enchanting soundtrack and stunning graphics. Get ready for a unique adventure, where the past meets the present in a whirlwind of mysteries, humor, and epic twists!",
    "about_the_game": "Immerse yourself in the platform games of the 90s with &quot;RISKY CHRONICLES and the Curse of Destiny&quot;! Experience a captivating adventure that cleverly blends classic platform game elements with modern mechanics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on the role of Risky, a fearless explorer, as you are transported through mythical locations such as an ancient pyramid, a mysterious Aztec temple, a ruthless desert, an enchanting underwater world, a haunted house full of secrets, an ancient military factory with intriguing mechanisms, a prehistoric cave full of mysteries, and many other surprises!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith diverse gameplay featuring levels in 2D and sequences in 3D scaling, &quot;RISKY CHRONICLES and the Curse of Destiny&quot; offers unforgettable encounters with end-level bosses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLet yourself be carried away by an enchanting soundtrack and stunning graphics. Get ready for a unique adventure, where the past meets the present in a whirlwind of mysteries, humor, and epic twists!",
    "short_description": "Embark on the role of Risky, our fearless adventurer, in an epic 2D and 3D adventure! Explore the enchanting worlds of this modern platform/adventure game.",
